                                                "sense_id": "797119d6-7abd-3f36-9286-daa90d7a53f2",
                                                "text": "The England manager and his players hardly deserve too much criticism after move into pole position in their group, but that comes with the caveat that there will be much sterner tests to come in the months ahead."
