                                                "sense_id": "797119d6-7abd-3f36-9286-daa90d7a53f2",
                                                "text": "It has proven that Nexus can undertake big infrastructure projects, putting it firmly in pole position to undertake the reopening of the Leamside line to Washington. [Tyne and Wear]"
